            "review_title": "Review at London Corner",
            "review_text": "MariaCoeli\nCebu City, Philippines56 contributions\n0\nLONDON CORNER Brunch\nJul 2025 • Friends\nLondon Corner\nDistrict 1\nHO CHI MINH CITY\nVIETNAM 🇻🇳\n\nWe decided to have brunch at London Corner Restaurant since it's just walking distance from our condominium. The ambience was superb and classy, with a design that felt very \"Londony.\" The staff were accommodating, polite, and kind.\n\nThe only issue was with communication and instructions—a few times, they got the orders wrong because the instructions relayed to the kitchen were different from what we requested. They also don’t provide service water; you have to purchase bottled mineral water. The sirloin steak was substandard, but the prices were reasonable.\n\nOverall, I would still recommend the place because it's very Instagrammable.\nRead more\nWritten July 2, 2025",
