            "review_title": "Review at London Corner",
            "review_text": "Jimmy H\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam11 contributions\n0\nNot so London\nNov 2024 • Family\nTerrible experience from start to finish. We ordered a tea set that included a cake, but the cake never arrived—just a weak apology with no attempt to fix it. When we asked for takeaway, they handed us a GS25 plastic bag, which felt completely unprofessional for a place charging such high prices. The parking was also charged, which added to the frustration.\n\nThe service was poor, and the menu is misleading—what they advertise and what you actually get are totally different. This place seems to care more about being Instagram-worthy than delivering quality food or service. Even the atmosphere was ruined, as no one seemed to know how to close the door behind them. Overpriced, unprofessional, and underdelivered. Stay away from this place!\nRead more\nWritten November 17, 2024",
